oocommerce_thumbnail-width":84,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":84,"woocommerce_single":93,"woocommerce_single-width":84,"woocommerce_single-height":84,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":93,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":84,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":84},{"frame_1":129},{"eyebrow":130,"header":131,"description":132},"Portfolio","Our Diverse Project Showcase","\u003Cp>Turning bold ideas into campaigns that inspire, engage, and deliver results. Let’s create something impactful together.\u003C/p>\n",[134,178],{"date":135,"slug":136,"title":137,"acf":139},"2025-09-24T09:50:09","business-card-design",{"rendered":138},"Business Card Design",{"thumbnail":140,"frame_1":169,"frame_2":174,"frame_3":175,"frame_4":176,"frame_5":177},{"image":141,"excerpt":168},{"ID":142,"id":142,"title":143,"filename":144,"filesize":145,"url":146,"link":147,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":143,"name":148,"status":15,"uploaded_to":149,"date":150,"modified":150,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":151,"type":20,"subtype":152,"icon":22,"width":153,"height":153,"sizes":154},2153,"Business card mockup psd for nature shop","Business-Cards-scaled.jpg",457395,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Business-Cards-scaled.jpg","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/index.php/portfolios/business-card-design/business-card-mockup-psd-for-nature-shop-2/","business-card-mockup-psd-for-nature-shop-2",2147,"2025-09-24 09:41:31","image/jpeg","jpeg",2560,{"thumbnail":155,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":156,"medium-width":29,"medium-height":29,"medium_large":157,"medium_large-width":158,"medium_large-height":158,"large":159,"large-width":160,"large-height":160,"1536x1536":161,"1536x1536-width":162,"1536x1536-height":162,"2048x2048":163,"2048x2048-width":164,"2048x2048-height":164,"woocommerce_thumbnail":156,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":29,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":29,"woocommerce_single":165,"woocommerce_single-width":166,"woocommerce_single-height":166,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":167,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Business-Cards-150x150.jpg","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Business-Cards-300x300.jpg","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Business-Cards-768x768.jpg",768,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Business-Cards-1024x1024.jpg",1024,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Business-Cards-1536x1536.jpg",1536,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Business-Cards-2048x2048.jpg",2048,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Business-Cards-600x600.jpg",600,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Business-Cards-100x100.jpg","Miraculous Minds engaged us to design a business card that embodies its brand identity—creative, bold, forward‐thinking—while maintaining a clean, professional appearance. The card needed to make a lasting impression, be easy to read, and provide multiple ways for people to connect (e.g. via traditional contact methods and digitally).",{"banner":170,"header":12,"description":172,"tags":173},{"ID":142,"id":142,"title":143,"filename":144,"filesize":145,"url":146,"link":147,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":143,"name":148,"status":15,"uploaded_to":149,"date":150,"modified":150,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":151,"type":20,"subtype":152,"icon":22,"width":153,"height":153,"sizes":171},{"thumbnail":155,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":156,"medium-width":29,"medium-height":29,"medium_large":157,"medium_large-width":158,"medium_large-height":158,"large":159,"large-width":160,"large-height":160,"1536x1536":161,"1536x1536-width":162,"1536x1536-height":162,"2048x2048":163,"2048x2048-width":164,"2048x2048-height":164,"woocommerce_thumbnail":156,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":29,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":29,"woocommerce_single":165,"woocommerce_single-width":166,"woocommerce_single-height":166,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":167,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"2. The Challenge\r\n\r\nBalancing creativity and legibility: The brand wanted vibrant, artistic visuals but not at the expense of information being clear and accessible.\r\n\r\nBrand consistency: Ensuring the design reflects the brand identity (name, logo, color scheme) cohesively across both front and back of card.\r\n\r\nMultiple contact points: Besides phone and email, including modern features like a QR code without overwhelming the layout.\r\n\r\nVisual impact: Standing out from typical business cards, especially in creative or tech‐connected industries, while preserving professionalism.\r\n\r\n3. Our Approach\r\n\r\nBrand audit / mood exploration: We reviewed the existing logo (colorful “brain / network” motif), tone of the name “Miraculous Minds,” and what those suggest in terms of color, shape, and form (innovation, creativity, intelligence).\r\n\r\nSketching & layout exploration: Rough layouts where geometric shapes frame or accent content, experimenting with placement of logo, name, and contact info.\r\n\r\nColor palette refinement: Choosing bold, vibrant shades but ensuring contrast (especially text vs background) remains high for readability.\r\n\r\nIconography and interactivity: Deciding on clean icons for contact methods; integrating a QR code for digital linkage.\r\n\r\nWhite space and simplicity: Leaving breathing room so that strong visuals don’t clutter the card or distract from essential text.\r\n\r\n4. The Solution\r\n\r\nDesign composition:\r\n\r\nFront: Big bold logo + company name with vibrant geometric edge at the bottom right; clean and impressive.\r\n\r\nBack: Contact info laid out simply; decorative polygons on the left side; QR code inserted to invite scanning without dominating.\r\n\r\nTypography: Use of sans‐serif fonts — bold for the company name, lighter weight for other elements like name, position, and contact details — to maintain hierarchy.\r\n\r\nGraphic motif: Low‐poly triangle clusters in multiple bright colors (purple, red, orange, green, blue) to reflect energy and multi‐faceted creativity.\r\n\r\nFunctional features: Icons to quickly show address / phone / email; QR code for fast digital access; alignment and spacing so the eye flows logically.\r\n\r\n5. Outcome & Key Takeaways\r\n\r\nThe business card delivers strong brand recognition at first glance thanks to its bold graphics and cohesive logo integration.\r\n\r\nContact information is clear and easily accessible, with modern features (QR code) adding usability.\r\n\r\nThe visual flair sets it apart from more conservative business cards, helping Miraculous Minds present itself as innovative and creative.\r\n\r\nKey design lessons: vivid color + geometric forms can enhance brand personality, but attention to typography, spacing, and hierarchy is essential to retain clarity.",false,{"image":173,"title":12,"description":12},{"testimonial":173},{"image":173,"title":12,"description":12},{"image":173,"title":12,"description":12},{"date":179,"slug":180,"title":181,"acf":183},"2025-02-22T07:45:58","alpha-apparel-logo-design",{"rendered":182},"Alpha Apparel Logo Design",{"thumbnail":184,"frame_1":209,"frame_2":239,"frame_3":244,"frame_4":267,"frame_5":288},{"image":185,"excerpt":208},{"ID":186,"id":186,"title":187,"filename":188,"filesize":189,"url":190,"link":191,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":12,"name":187,"status":15,"uploaded_to":192,"date":193,"modified":193,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":151,"type":20,"subtype":152,"icon":22,"width":194,"height":195,"sizes":196},1300,"aplha","aplha.jpg",247612,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/aplha.jpg","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/index.php/portfolios/alpha-apparel-logo-design/aplha/",1270,"2025-02-22 08:01:14",1400,1307,{"thumbnail":197,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":198,"medium-width":29,"medium-height":199,"medium_large":200,"medium_large-width":158,"medium_large-height":201,"large":202,"large-width":160,"large-height":203,"1536x1536":190,"1536x1536-width":194,"1536x1536-height":195,"2048x2048":190,"2048x2048-width":194,"2048x2048-height":195,"woocommerce_thumbnail":204,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":29,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":29,"woocommerce_single":205,"woocommerce_single-width":166,"woocommerce_single-height":206,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":207,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/aplha-150x150.jpg","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/aplha-300x280.jpg",280,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/aplha-768x717.jpg",717,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/aplha-1024x956.jpg",956,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/aplha-300x300.jpg","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/aplha-600x560.jpg",560,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/aplha-100x100.jpg","Alpha Apparel is a rising brand in the contemporary fashion scene, focused on providing unique, high-quality clothing that stands out from the crowd.",{"banner":210,"header":182,"description":231,"tags":232},{"ID":211,"id":211,"title":212,"filename":213,"filesize":214,"url":215,"link":216,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":12,"name":212,"status":15,"uploaded_to":192,"date":217,"modified":217,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":19,"type":20,"subtype":21,"icon":22,"width":218,"height":219,"sizes":220},1299,"alpha-header","alpha-header.png",792150,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha-header.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/index.php/portfolios/alpha-apparel-logo-design/alpha-header/","2025-02-22 08:00:22",1440,711,{"thumbnail":221,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":222,"medium-width":29,"medium-height":223,"medium_large":224,"medium_large-width":158,"medium_large-height":225,"large":226,"large-width":160,"large-height":227,"1536x1536":215,"1536x1536-width":218,"1536x1536-height":219,"2048x2048":215,"2048x2048-width":218,"2048x2048-height":219,"woocommerce_thumbnail":228,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":29,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":29,"woocommerce_single":229,"woocommerce_single-width":166,"woocommerce_single-height":24,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":230,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha-header-150x150.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha-header-300x148.png",148,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha-header-768x379.png",379,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha-header-1024x506.png",506,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha-header-300x300.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha-header-600x296.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha-header-100x100.png","Develop a unique and memorable logo that represents Alpha Apparel's commitment to contemporary style, durability, and community, targeting a young, fashion-conscious demographic.",[233,235,237],{"tag_label":234},"Tags Sample 1",{"tag_label":236},"Tags Sample 2",{"tag_label":238},"Tags Sample 3",{"image":240,"title":242,"description":243},{"ID":186,"id":186,"title":187,"filename":188,"filesize":189,"url":190,"link":191,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":12,"name":187,"status":15,"uploaded_to":192,"date":193,"modified":193,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":151,"type":20,"subtype":152,"icon":22,"width":194,"height":195,"sizes":241},{"thumbnail":197,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":198,"medium-width":29,"medium-height":199,"medium_large":200,"medium_large-width":158,"medium_large-height":201,"large":202,"large-width":160,"large-height":203,"1536x1536":190,"1536x1536-width":194,"1536x1536-height":195,"2048x2048":190,"2048x2048-width":194,"2048x2048-height":195,"woocommerce_thumbnail":204,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":29,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":29,"woocommerce_single":205,"woocommerce_single-width":166,"woocommerce_single-height":206,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":207,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"Defining the Alpha Aesthetic","\u003Cul class=\"list-disc list-outside leading-relaxed space-y-2 pl-4\">\n\u003Cli>Alpha Apparel is a rising brand in the contemporary fashion scene, focused on providing unique, high-quality clothing that stands out from the crowd. They needed a logo that reflected this modern approach while also conveying a sense of lasting quality.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>The target audience is young adults (18-35) who are interested in fashion, value individuality, and appreciate brands with a strong identity and community presence. They are active on social media and seek out brands that align with their personal style.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>The existing market is saturated with minimalist and often generic logos. Alpha Apparel wanted to differentiate itself with a logo that felt both sophisticated and approachable, conveying a sense of confidence and exclusivity without being pretentious.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Key design challenges included: Balancing a modern aesthetic with a timeless feel. Creating a logo that would work well across various applications (clothing tags, website, social media, etc.). Visually representing the brand&#8217;s core values (style, durability, community).\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n",{"testimonial":245},[246,264],{"image":247,"name":261,"designation":262,"testimony":263},{"ID":248,"id":248,"title":249,"filename":250,"filesize":251,"url":252,"link":253,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":12,"name":254,"status":15,"uploaded_to":192,"date":255,"modified":255,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":19,"type":20,"subtype":21,"icon":22,"width":256,"height":257,"sizes":258},1301,"testimony6","testimony6.png",80125,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/testimony6.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/index.php/portfolios/alpha-apparel-logo-design/testimony6-2/","testimony6-2","2025-02-22 08:01:44",204,192,{"thumbnail":259,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":252,"medium-width":256,"medium-height":257,"medium_large":252,"medium_large-width":256,"medium_large-height":257,"large":252,"large-width":256,"large-height":257,"1536x1536":252,"1536x1536-width":256,"1536x1536-height":257,"2048x2048":252,"2048x2048-width":256,"2048x2048-height":257,"woocommerce_thumbnail":252,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":256,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":257,"woocommerce_single":252,"woocommerce_single-width":256,"woocommerce_single-height":257,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":260,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/testimony6-150x150.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/testimony6-100x100.png","John Doe","CEO, Alpha Apparel","truly understood our brand and what we were trying to achieve. The logo they designed perfectly captures the essence of Alpha Apparel – it's modern, stylish, and has a strong presence. We've received incredibly positive feedback from our customers.",{"image":265,"name":261,"designation":262,"testimony":263},{"ID":248,"id":248,"title":249,"filename":250,"filesize":251,"url":252,"link":253,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":12,"name":254,"status":15,"uploaded_to":192,"date":255,"modified":255,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":19,"type":20,"subtype":21,"icon":22,"width":256,"height":257,"sizes":266},{"thumbnail":259,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":252,"medium-width":256,"medium-height":257,"medium_large":252,"medium_large-width":256,"medium_large-height":257,"large":252,"large-width":256,"large-height":257,"1536x1536":252,"1536x1536-width":256,"1536x1536-height":257,"2048x2048":252,"2048x2048-width":256,"2048x2048-height":257,"woocommerce_thumbnail":252,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":256,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":257,"woocommerce_single":252,"woocommerce_single-width":256,"woocommerce_single-height":257,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":260,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},{"image":268,"title":286,"description":287},{"ID":269,"id":269,"title":270,"filename":271,"filesize":272,"url":273,"link":274,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":12,"name":270,"status":15,"uploaded_to":192,"date":275,"modified":275,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":19,"type":20,"subtype":21,"icon":22,"width":276,"height":277,"sizes":278},1302,"alpha2","alpha2.png",597018,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha2.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/index.php/portfolios/alpha-apparel-logo-design/alpha2/","2025-02-22 08:02:32",616,640,{"thumbnail":279,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":280,"medium-width":281,"medium-height":29,"medium_large":273,"medium_large-width":276,"medium_large-height":277,"large":273,"large-width":276,"large-height":277,"1536x1536":273,"1536x1536-width":276,"1536x1536-height":277,"2048x2048":273,"2048x2048-width":276,"2048x2048-height":277,"woocommerce_thumbnail":282,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":29,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":29,"woocommerce_single":283,"woocommerce_single-width":166,"woocommerce_single-height":284,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":285,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha2-150x150.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha2-289x300.png",289,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha2-300x300.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha2-600x623.png",623,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha2-100x100.png","Our Creative Journey: From Concept to Creation","\u003Cul class=\"list-disc list-outside leading-relaxed space-y-2 pl-4\">\n\u003Cli>nitial Research &amp; Mood Boards: The process began with in-depth research into the contemporary fashion landscape, competitor analysis, and target audience preferences. Mood boards were created to explore various visual styles, typography, and color palettes that aligned with Alpha Apparel&#8217;s brand identity. Keywords guiding the design were: modern, bold, sophisticated, minimal, confident, timeless, edgy (but not aggressive).\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Sketching &amp; Ideation: Multiple logo concepts were explored through hand-drawn sketches, focusing on creating a unique and memorable symbol. Key ideas included:\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Abstract representations of the letter &#8220;A.&#8221;\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Geometric shapes conveying strength and stability.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Symbols that hinted at connection and community.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Monograms combining the letters &#8220;A&#8221; and &#8220;P.&#8221;\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Digital Refinement: The strongest concepts were digitized and refined in [Software Name]. Different variations of each concept were explored, testing various font pairings, line weights, and color combinations.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Client Feedback &amp; Iteration: The refined concepts were presented to the Alpha Apparel team for feedback. Their input was crucial in selecting the final direction and making further refinements to ensure the logo perfectly aligned with their vision.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Color Palette Selection: A color palette was chosen to complement the logo and reflect the brand&#8217;s personality. [Explain the color choices – e.g., &#8220;A primary color of deep charcoal was selected for its sophistication and versatility, with accents of a muted gold to convey a touch of luxury and warmth.&#8221;]\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Typography Selection: Select the best typography that fits the overall look of the brand.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n",{"image":289,"title":310,"description":311},{"ID":195,"id":195,"title":290,"filename":291,"filesize":292,"url":293,"link":294,"alt":12,"author":13,"description":12,"caption":12,"name":290,"status":15,"uploaded_to":192,"date":295,"modified":295,"menu_order":18,"mime_type":19,"type":20,"subtype":21,"icon":22,"width":296,"height":297,"sizes":298},"alpha3","alpha3.png",1001455,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha3.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/index.php/portfolios/alpha-apparel-logo-design/alpha3/","2025-02-22 08:03:38",1312,738,{"thumbnail":299,"thumbnail-width":27,"thumbnail-height":27,"medium":300,"medium-width":29,"medium-height":301,"medium_large":302,"medium_large-width":158,"medium_large-height":303,"large":304,"large-width":160,"large-height":305,"1536x1536":293,"1536x1536-width":296,"1536x1536-height":297,"2048x2048":293,"2048x2048-width":296,"2048x2048-height":297,"woocommerce_thumbnail":306,"woocommerce_thumbnail-width":29,"woocommerce_thumbnail-height":29,"woocommerce_single":307,"woocommerce_single-width":166,"woocommerce_single-height":308,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail":309,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-width":33,"woocommerce_gallery_thumbnail-height":33},"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha3-150x150.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha3-300x169.png",169,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha3-768x432.png",432,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha3-1024x576.png",576,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha3-300x300.png","https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha3-600x338.png",338,"https://admin.hiddentreasuresagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alpha3-100x100.png","Project Outcome: Elevating the Alpha Apparel Brand","\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Successful Brand Alignment: The logo perfectly captures the essence of Alpha Apparel, as confirmed by positive client feedback and internal team alignment.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Enhanced Market Differentiation: The unique design helps Alpha Apparel stand out in a crowded marketplace, attracting attention and fostering brand loyalty.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Seamless Integration: The logo has been seamlessly integrated across all brand materials, creating a cohesive and professional brand presence.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Positive Customer Response: Early feedback from Alpha Apparel&#8217;s customer base indicates a strong positive response to the new logo and visual identity.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Ready for scaling: The design is ready for large scaling project.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n",1758709824774]